LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 4)
  using 128 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# LAMMPS input script

variable seed equal 7545

boundary p p p
units       metal
atom_style  atomic
atom_modify map array sort 0 0
read_data data.init
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-24.754513 -25.01821 -24.354031) to (23.945349 47.534645 24.345829)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4360 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.014 seconds
pair_style tersoff
pair_coeff  * *  AW.tersoff AW

# ----- Variables -----
variable T equal 180
variable P equal 1.0
variable Nrestart equal 100

# ----- Initialize -----
velocity  all create ${T} ${seed}
velocity  all create 180 ${seed}
velocity  all create 180 7545
neighbor 2.0 nsq
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
fix rmMomentum all  momentum 1 linear 1 1 1

# ----- Computes -----
compute msd all  msd com yes

# ----- Log -----
thermo        ${Nrestart}
thermo        100
thermo_style custom step atoms pe ke temp press density lx ly lz etotal enthalpy c_msd[4]
thermo_modify line multi norm yes flush yes format float %.8g

# ----- Minimize -----

minimize 1e-4 1e-6 1000 10000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
